flowchart TD
    A[Question] --> P[Planner: two legal domains]
    P -->|reject| R[Refusal branch]
    P -->|ask_user| C[Clarification branch]
    P -->|rag| D[Dense variants / RRF / CE / BERT]
    D --> G[Grader: total max 2 retrieval rounds / best result]
    G --> N[Generator: full chunks plus highlights]
    N -->|no citations and web off| F[No-source message]
    N -->|citations 0-based| H[Checker: cited source text only]
    H -->|false AND confidence ge .75 AND claims ge 2| X[Regenerate once - no recheck]
    H -->|other including parse fail-open| U[Final answer and source cards]
    X --> U
    U --> V[GET /api/source/id - source dialog]
    E[Provider or pipeline failure] --> Z[Error - not correct refusal]
